	(text "D1170 (host port) then D1171-D1175 (targets 1-5) are one SK6812 chain (GRB, 800 kHz) from LED_DATA through U1171 at 5V.\nU1172 sets host selection. EXP_RESET_N holds it in reset until firmware releases it; while reset or unset,\nthe pulls hold SEL_CM5=1 and SEL_EXT=EXT_ORIENT=EXT_LINK=0. P4 is HUB_RUN (pulled up), P5 HUB_SMB_EN (hub SMBus pull-ups). TCA_RESET_N is a direct open-drain GPIO.\nConfirmation is a separate firmware action; attachment alone does not authorize erase."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 264.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "566463e9-764c-4bb0-926e-1dd48122d4b4")
	)
	(text "Port indicators and physical confirmation"
